  "title": "Data for Canada - Environment, Climate, and Health Data Packages",
  "description": "Time-series environmental sensor readings from a network of low-cost Enviro+ IoT monitoring stations deployed across Canada, measuring particulate matter, gas concentrations (oxidised, reducing, NH3), temperature, pressure, humidity, and light, alongside companion device-telemetry data (CPU, memory, network, power) used for quality-control filtering of the sensor readings.",
